# apps/desktop/tests/artifacts/ and apps/desktop/test-results/ were here. The
# desktop app moved to its own repository on 12 Sep 2026
# and its .gitignore went with it, carrying both. `out/` above is NOT desktop
# leftovers — apps/mcp and the templates write there too.

# The PACKAGED scaffold (build-7, 13 Sep 2026). `apps/mcp/scripts/build.mjs`
# copies /templates/universal to apps/mcp/templates/universal on every build so
# `npm pack` ships it inside the @vibtra/mcp tarball — create-vite's
# "files": ["index.js", "template-*", "dist"] shape. It is BUILD OUTPUT, not a
# second source of truth: /templates/universal is the copy that is edited and
# workspace-linked, this one is deleted and rewritten every run, and npm's own
# packlist never reads this file (it only consults ignore files inside the
# package), so ignoring it here does not unship it.
#
# THE SCAFFOLD'S node_modules IS NEVER IN IT AND IS NEVER COMMITTED: the copy
# filters `node_modules` out (a pnpm symlink farm cannot be published), the
# build fails if any survives, and `node_modules/` at the head of this file
# catches it a second time.
apps/mcp/templates/

# Render + verifier output. `apps/console/scripts/{shot-port,measure-console}.ts`
# default their output root S here (13 Sep 2026, GAPS platform-57) now that they
# no longer point at a session scratchpad. PNGs, never source.
apps/console/.renders/
.vercel

